<section id="process" class="py-32 bg-gray-50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-20">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-light tracking-tight text-gray-900 mb-6">
        My Thinking Process
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Every project / feature is a unique challenge. 
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
      
      <div class="relative group">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 h-full">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-black text-white rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <span class="text-2xl font-light">1</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-900 mb-4">Understanding the project</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Understanding not only the "how" but also the "why" of the project is key to success. I like to have all the information before I work for better efficiency.
          </p>
          
        </div>
        <div class="hidden lg:block absolute -right-4 top-1/2 transform -translate-y-1/2 z-10">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-gray-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      
      <div class="relative group">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 h-full">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-black text-white rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <span class="text-2xl font-light">2</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-900 mb-4">Code and give feedback</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6 items-center justify-center">
            Work on the project but offering my insights and suggestions to improve the final product. 
          </p>
          
        </div>
        <div class="hidden lg:block absolute -right-4 top-1/2 transform -translate-y-1/2 z-10">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-gray-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      
      <div class="relative group">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 h-full">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-black text-white rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <span class="text-2xl font-light">3</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-900 mb-4">Refine and iterate</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            I like to take on suggestions for improvements on the project and apply them to achieve the best result.
          </p>
          
        </div>
        <div class="hidden lg:block absolute -right-4 top-1/2 transform -translate-y-1/2 z-10">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-gray-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      
      <div class="group">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 h-full">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-black text-white rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <span class="text-2xl font-light">4</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-900 mb-4">Push & Monitor</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            After confirming the quality of the code with peer reviews, push the code to production and check the performance. 
          </p>
          
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    
  </div>
</section>


